<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HALAL WORK With ZORO TRADER 📊</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #0b0f19;
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 480px;
            background: #131b2e;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid #1f293d;
        }
        .badge-top {
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .profile-img-container {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
            border-radius: 50%;
            padding: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #3b82f6);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
        }
        .profile-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        .verified-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
            color: #f59e0b;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #60a5fa;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }
        h1 span {
            color: #f59e0b;
        }
        .description {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1d4ed8);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8, #1e40af);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.6);
        }
        .features {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: #1f293d;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .disclaimer {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #64748b;
            line-height: 1.4;
            text-align: left;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="badge-top">RESEARCH & MARKET EDUCATION • TRADING COMMUNITY</div>

        <div class="profile-img-container">
            <img src="https://i.ibb.co/v4Qp0Gnb/IMG-20261104-100350-538.jpg" alt="Zoro Trader" class="profile-img">
        </div>

        <div class="verified-badge">
            ✓ HALAL WORK & MARKET EDUCATOR
        </div>

        <div class="subtitle">STOCK MARKET & ANALYSIS EDUCATOR</div>

        <h1>HALAL WORK With <br><span>ZORO TRADER 📊</span></h1>

        <p class="description">Daily Market Analysis • Ethical Insights & Learning Modules • Clear Guidance</p>

        <a href="https://t.me/+OLwXQruS22FiZDA1" target="_blank" class="cta-button">
            ✈️ Join Telegram Community — Free
        </a>

        <div class="features">
            <div>🔒 Instant Free Access — 100% Educational Content</div>
            <div>👥 Join our growing trading community</div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="disclaimer">
            <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> Yeh page sirf educational aur research purpose ke liye hai. Hum SEBI registered analyst nahi hain. Stock market mein trading aur investment karna jokhim bhara ho sakta hai. Koi bhi financial decision lene se pehle apne financial advisor se salah zaroor lein. Yeh community kisi bhi tarah ke profit ya loss ki guarantee nahi deti.
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
